years too late on that.

00:33:15.270 --> 00:33:17.120
- That's what happens when you innovate.

00:33:17.120 --> 00:33:17.953
Good luck brother.

00:33:17.953 --> 00:33:19.223
- [Heath] I'm very appreciative
