00:33:28.389 --> 00:33:29.222
- I think it's right.

00:33:29.222 --> 00:33:30.055
I think Heath made a
really important point,

00:33:30.055 --> 00:33:32.720
and again trying to make this
valuable for my audience,

00:33:33.570 --> 00:33:36.420
I always talk about watch
