00:37:57.103 --> 00:37:58.760
I'm trying to teach myself photography,

00:37:58.760 --> 00:38:00.492
teach myself videography.

00:38:00.492 --> 00:38:03.930
And with really the intent of knowing

00:38:03.930 --> 00:38:08.930
that some day that I want
to hopefully impact somebody

00:38:09.540 --> 00:38:11.618
in a way where they feel
better about themselves.

00:38:11.618 --> 00:38:13.550
I'm on my own journey

00:38:13.550 --> 00:38:14.670
