00:50:40.084 --> 00:50:41.140
- You could finish badly, exactly.

00:50:41.140 --> 00:50:43.320
I think about finishing well all the time.

00:50:43.320 --> 00:50:46.193
- As you should especially
if you've ever had not good.

00:50:47.240 --> 00:50:49.810
If you've had not good and
now you're in the good zone.

00:50:49.810 --> 00:50:50.643
- And we have kids too.

00:50:50.643 --> 00:50:52.610
We start thinking about the men

00:50:52.610 --> 00:50:54.980
we wanna be for our
children and our wives.

00:50:54.980 --> 00:50:56.640
- I've had some really
deep conversations lately

00:50:56.640 --> 00:50:59.145
of people that feel in a trap of nobleness

00:50:59.145 --> 00:51:00.550
because of their parents,

00:51:00.550 --> 00:51:02.150
but don't feel accountable to their kids.

00:51:02.150 --> 00:51:05.840
I had the craziest convo I've ever had.

00:51:05.840 --> 00:51:08.540
I'm sorry, I just I couldn't believe this.

00:51:08.540 --> 00:51:09.710
Somebody telling me
that they couldn't wait

00:51:09.710 --> 00:51:12.690
for their parents to die so
they could have some fun.

00:51:12.690 --> 00:51:15.923
And just everybody's
living different lives.

00:51:17.077 --> 00:51:19.093
- [Felix] Do you guys
have an practical advice

00:51:19.093 --> 00:51:21.283
on getting rid of that poison?

00:51:22.280 --> 00:51:24.430
- Well look, I think you're
doing it right now brother.

00:51:24.430 --> 00:51:26.885
I think one of the quickest
ways to get out poison

00:51:26.885 --> 00:51:30.200
is to over communicate
and expose yourself.

00:51:30.200 --> 00:51:31.838
That's what Scott did.

00:51:31.838 --> 00:51:34.100
How many people are pumped about talking

00:51:34.100 --> 00:51:36.350
about being addicted to
pornography, cocaine?

00:51:37.378 --> 00:51:38.211
I think you're doing it.

00:51:38.211 --> 00:51:40.160
- I just do it to help people.

00:51:40.160 --> 00:51:41.430
- And it helped you too bro.

00:51:41.430 --> 00:51:42.500
- [Scott] There's a trust too.

00:51:42.500 --> 00:51:45.690
- Bro, listen what happened with me.

00:51:45.690 --> 00:51:46.830
You wanna know I became the entrepreneur?

00:51:46.830 --> 00:51:47.700
- I'm just doing therapy in front

00:51:47.700 --> 00:51:49.030
of 10,000 people on stages.

00:51:49.030 --> 00:51:51.220
- You know why I became the
entrepreneur's entrepreneur?

00:51:51.220 --> 00:51:52.450
Let me give you the preview.

00:51:52.450 --> 00:51:54.150
In 2006, seven, eight, nine, 10,

00:51:54.150 --> 00:51:56.010
when it wasn't as cool to
go to Mount Ida College

00:51:56.010 --> 00:51:58.110
and get Ds and Fs, and all that.

00:51:58.110 --> 00:51:59.610
When everybody judged
me because they all went

00:51:59.610 --> 00:52:01.240
to Georgetown and Yale and all this.

00:52:01.240 --> 00:52:04.470
In my circle, of all the
Silicon Valley winners,

00:52:04.470 --> 00:52:05.620
I kept doing it.

00:52:05.620 --> 00:52:06.870
Because it was my truth,

00:52:06.870 --> 00:52:08.070
it was liberating.

00:52:08.070 --> 00:52:08.920
It was the truth.

00:52:08.920 --> 00:52:10.370
And then the market moved in a way

00:52:10.370 --> 00:52:11.940
that made it more acceptable.

00:52:11.940 --> 00:52:12.957
What would I do if I were you?

00:52:12.957 --> 00:52:15.290
I'd go on Instagram right
now and make a video

00:52:15.290 --> 00:52:18.525
and tell every fucking
secret, insecurity you got,

00:52:18.525 --> 00:52:20.170
just completely let it go.

00:52:20.170 --> 00:52:22.126
It might feel safe in this
environment right here.

00:52:22.126 --> 00:52:24.635
Put it in every circle of your life.

00:52:24.635 --> 00:52:27.313
It will lose its leverage.

00:52:28.500 --> 00:52:29.490
- [Felix] Right.

00:52:29.490 --> 00:52:32.450
- Our secrets of our insecurities

00:52:32.450 --> 00:52:36.530
are the jails of our emotions.

00:52:36.530 --> 00:52:39.880
The way to free it up is
to put it out in the wild.

00:52:39.880 --> 00:52:41.820
I have very deep friends
and family right now

00:52:41.820 --> 00:52:44.130
that I wish they'd make
one 60 second video

00:52:44.130 --> 00:52:46.270
on Instagram and tell the world the truth

00:52:46.270 --> 00:52:47.760
of the one thing they've been holding.

00:52:47.760 --> 00:52:50.470
They wouldn't believe how light

00:52:50.470 --> 00:52:51.920
they would feel the next day.

00:52:53.170 --> 00:52:54.003
I believe that.

00:52:54.003 --> 00:52:55.260
- And that was this
process for me as well.

00:52:55.260 --> 00:52:57.150
- Thanks brother, thanks for calling.

00:52:57.150 --> 00:52:58.500
Final thoughts brother.

00:52:58.500 --> 00:53:00.550
